 "lines": [
  "Why does a tiny bump throw you off the board?",
  "Follow, I fix one surf mistake a day.",
  "Look at his knees. Locked straight.",
  "Straight legs can't give, so the bump hits your whole body.",
  "Bent knees work like springs and soak it up.",
  "So ride low, like you're sitting on a chair.",
  "Film one wave, and SurfTribe measures your knee angle.",
  "Here it shows 175 degrees. That leg is almost straight.",
  "Tomorrow's video: how to spot a rip current from the beach, the water that drags you out to sea."
